# Test: ze completion words -- show bgp reject-asn subcommand completion
# VALIDATES: the YANG command schema publishes the reject-asn command tree, so
#            an operator reaches `name` and `known transit-free` by Tab
# PREVENTS: ze-filter-path-asn-cmd.yang removed or broken without detection

cmd=foreground:seq=1:exec=ze completion words run show bgp reject-asn
expect=exit:code=0
expect=stdout:contains=name
expect=stdout:contains=known

cmd=foreground:seq=2:exec=ze completion words run show bgp reject-asn known
expect=exit:code=0
expect=stdout:contains=transit-free
